%!  r_plot_bubbles(+RPlot, +X:list(float), +Y:list(float), +Radii:list(float), +Label:string, +Color:rgb, -Result:r_plot) is det.
%
%   Adds markers with independently specified radii.
%
%   Calls the C++ method `datamunge::graphics::RPlot::bubbles`.
%
%   Marker areas grow with radius squared. A radius of zero omits the observation.
