%!  rbf_gaussian_process_surrogate_prior_mean(+RbfGaussianProcessSurrogate, -Result:float) is det.
%
%   The prior mean: the mean of the values when normalising, else 0.
%
%   Calls the C++ method `datamunge::optim::RBFGaussianProcessSurrogate::prior_mean`.
