%   ==
%
%   *References*
%
%     - R. Johnson and T. Zhang (2013), Accelerating Stochastic Gradient Descent using Predictive Variance Reduction, https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper/2013/hash/ac1dd209cbcc5e5d1c6e28598e8cbbe8-Abstract.html

