%!  arima_options_coefficient_bound(+ArimaOptions, -Value:float) is det.
%
%   Box constraint [-bound, bound] applied to every AR/MA coefficient during optimization. (float).
arima_options_coefficient_bound(ArimaOptions, Value) :-
